OL,3,GNEWSAFirst performers take to the stage
OL,4,Aat festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FPerformers have taken to the stage as
OL,7,Fthe Reading Festival officially got
OL,8,Funder way.
OL,10,FOrganisers have said it is the first
OL,11,Ftime for 25 years that all headliners
OL,12,Fat Reading and its sister festival in
OL,13,FLeeds are exclusively British and Irish
OL,14,Facts.
OL,16,FAbout 100,000 people are expected to
OL,17,Fsee performers including Charli xcx,
OL,18,FRaye, Chase & Status, Dave and
OL,19,FFontaines D.C., ahead of the annual
OL,20,Fevent closing on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
